bugs/RVP9-BUG-FLU-00027.md:26:On AArch64 macOS, MIRIFLAGS=-Zmiri-disable-isolation cargo miri test --package rvp9-core --lib loopfilter::apply::tests::empty_mask_grid_no_op reports Undefined Behavior at SharedFrame::y_slice: the Y pointer tag was invalidated by a later unique retag in Yv12Buffer::u_plane_mut. Expected: the empty-mask loop-filter path completes without an aliasing violation. Actual: Miri aborts while reconstructing the Y slice.
