bugs/RVP9-BUG-FLUX-00012.md:26:Observation: `cargo clippy -p rvp9-encoder --all-targets -- -D warnings` fails at `crates/rvp9-encoder/src/aq_cyclic_refresh.rs:989` with `clippy::manual_contains`. The same failure reproduces from a clean archive of commit f3a330c2, so it predates the denoiser worktree. Expected: the documented all-target clippy gate passes; actual: the AQ test uses `seg_map.iter().any(|&s| s == CR_SEGMENT_ID_BOOST)` where current clippy requires `seg_map.contains(&CR_SEGMENT_ID_BOOST)`.
